<p>Deploy a defensive emplacement around you, summoning 2 guardian turrets in adjacent tiles for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns. Guardian turrets redirect <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 26%, 35%, 43%, 50%</acronym> of all damage taken by other adjacent allies (other than fellow guardian turrets) to themselves, and each is armed with a powerful turret capable of firing piercing bullets.</p><p>Guardian Turrets gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.00, 2.00, 3.00, 4.00, 5.00</acronym> ranks in Steamgun Mastery based on your Hunker Down talent level.</p>